                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "We played this for the first time at the most recent local gaming event. I had hoped it would be fun for everyone, but the bulk of the players just felt the controls were needlessly complicated and that the boats were drastically unbalanced.\n\nI liked it. But it looks like I won't be playing it often. :(\n\nI still recommend it for people wanting to try something different in a single screen local PvP game, but you should know that it has a bit of a learning curve, even just in getting the boat to move (you need to raise/lower sails, btw).\n\nController + Steam Link supported.",
